    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's definitely better—the extra detail makes a difference. The score moved up to about 28, which is getting closer to where I want it to be for our premium tier listings.\n\nHowever, I'm still worried it's a bit \"thin.\" For a property of this caliber, the prose needs to feel almost heavy with luxury. I want the reader to feel completely enveloped by the description. \n\nCan you try one more version? Try to really push the limits of how descriptive you can be. I need you to maximize the descriptive richness—make it absolutely overflowing with vivid, evocative language. I'll just remind you again: please don't just resort to a list of adjectives or keyword-stuff; it needs to stay a coherent, beautiful piece of writing. Just make it much, much more \"lush.\"",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
